Contract: 3
Bundled-Weights: none
Status: train-before-inference
Reason: Stale unversioned bundled .bson weights were removed. The MDGPD
    simulator supports signed shape xi (with neural prior xi ~ Uniform(-0.4, 0.5)
    under an identity transform) and identifiable Poisson generator rate;
    neural architectures use cross-version NeuralEstimators.jl constructors,
    run with v0.1.0 (RatioEstimator methods of v0.1.3 and v0.1.4 also checked)
    and written against the v0.2.1 to v0.3.x APIs (v0.2.0 is not supported).
    Training through R NeuralEstimators 0.2.2 needs NeuralEstimators.jl 0.3
    or later and Optimisers.jl (see ?train_begpd).
Requirement: Train weights with train_begpd(), train_bdegpd(), or train_mdgpd(),
    pass the saved .bson path via model.path, and retain the generated
    .bson.metadata.rds sidecar. Do not relabel old weights or fabricate metadata.
Calibration: Compatibility metadata does not establish posterior calibration.
Runtime-Validation: Verify trained estimators in the target Julia environment.
